    "Sparred for over a",
    "half an hour steadily",
    "with Sharon; getting",
    "the worst of it of",
    "course; but I gave",
    "him his work.",
    "I have gotten pretty",
    "high marks in my",
    "hour examinations so",
    "far.",
    "I enjoy the Porcellian",
    "more and more every",
    "day; I like almost",
    "all the fellows—es-",
    "pecially Otho Williams"
